---
const { day } = Astro.props;
---
<p>Run the gate cold, no warm-up on the test itself.</p>
<h3>Gate</h3>
<p>{day.phase.gate}</p>
<ol>
  <li>Muting test: C on the G string, drive patch, four beats. Five in a row with nothing else ringing.</li>
  <li>Picking: three clean passes in a row at 60 BPM or more, four notes per click, on the high e.</li>
  <li>The recording from day 4 exists.</li>
</ol>
<p>All three: log it as passed, week 2 opens. Any miss: log which one, repeat the week. Repeating a week is the system working.</p>
